# HTML slide deck pattern

All slide decks (`Module {N} - Slides.html`, `Module {N} - Slides (Shareable).html`, `Course Overview`, `Pitch Deck`) follow this pattern, mirroring the AI Product Strategy reference deck so the two certifications read as a paired family.

## Brand identity

- **Background:** `#07162C` (deep navy)
- **Fonts:** `Poppins` 300–900 for headings + `Lato` 300/400/700 for body + `IBM Plex Mono` 400/500/600 for code.
- **Logo:** `Design/Minimalist shield with glowing _P_.png` placed at top of hero.
- **Branding line:** `Module {N} — AI Product Management Certification` in the section label.

